      "topic": "pk-punjab/xii/chemistry/c12-chem/ch19/u-11-amines-c-h-nh",
      "title": "11. Amines (CₙH₂ₙ₊₁NH₂) (Roman Urdu)",
      "language": "roman_ur",
      "variant_of": "C12-CHEM-CH19-19.4-11-AMINES-C-H-NH",
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "source_document_id": "2d720c54-503b-58ec-b5b1-3307f222f40c",
          "pdf_from": 41,
          "pdf_to": 41,
          "note": "11. Amines (CₙH₂ₙ₊₁NH₂): a main subheading of 19.4 Nomenclature of Aliphatic Organic Compounds, its own page (owner 2026-11-04); PDF 41-41."
        }
      ],
      "body": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Amines teen types ki hain:"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "a) Primary amines (–C–NH₂): IUPAC naam alkanamine hai. NH₂ kis carbon par hai, yeh number se batate hain.",
            "bold": [
              "Primary amines",
              "alkanamine"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "equation",
            "latex": "\\underset{\\text{ethanamine}}{\\ce{CH3-CH2-NH2}} \\qquad \\underset{\\text{propan-1-amine}}{\\ce{CH3-CH2-CH2-NH2}} \\qquad \\underset{\\text{propan-2-amine}}{\\ce{CH3-CH(NH2)-CH3}}",
            "text_alt": "CH₃–CH₂–NH₂ (ethanamine);  CH₃–CH₂–CH₂–NH₂ (propan-1-amine);  CH₃–CH(NH₂)–CH₃ (propan-2-amine)"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "b) Secondary amines (–C–NH–R): IUPAC naam N-alkylalkanamine hai. Nitrogen par laga chhota alkyl group “N-” ke saath likha jata hai.",
            "bold": [
              "Secondary amines",
              "N-alkylalkanamine"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "equation",
            "latex": "\\underset{\\text{N-methylpropan-1-amine}}{\\ce{CH3-CH2-CH2-NH-CH3}} \\qquad \\underset{\\text{N-methylpropan-2-amine}}{\\ce{CH3-CH(CH3)-NH-CH3}}",
            "text_alt": "CH₃–CH₂–CH₂–NH–CH₃ (N-methylpropan-1-amine);  CH₃–CH(CH₃)–NH–CH₃ (N-methylpropan-2-amine)"
          },
          {
            "type": "callout",
            "tone": "correction",
            "title": "Kitab ki ghalti",
            "text": "Kitab N-methylpropan-1-amine ko “CH₃–CH₂–CH₂–NH₂–CH₃” chhaapti hai. Secondary amine ke nitrogen par sirf aik H hota hai (NH₂ ke saath nitrogen ke chaar bond ho jate). Sahi: CH₃–CH₂–CH₂–NH–CH₃."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "c) Tertiary amines (–C–N(R)–R): agar dono R aik jaise hon to naam N,N-dialkylalkanamine, aur alag hon to N-alkyl-N-alkylalkanamine hota hai.",
            "bold": [
              "Tertiary amines"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "equation",
            "latex": "\\underset{\\text{N,N-dimethylpropan-1-amine}}{\\ce{CH3-CH2-CH2-N(CH3)-CH3}} \\qquad \\underset{\\text{N-ethyl-N-methylpropan-1-amine}}{\\ce{CH3-CH2-CH2-N(CH3)-CH2-CH3}}",
            "text_alt": "CH₃–CH₂–CH₂–N(CH₃)–CH₃ (N,N-dimethylpropan-1-amine);  CH₃–CH₂–CH₂–N(CH₃)–CH₂–CH₃ (N-ethyl-N-methylpropan-1-amine)"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
